  "query_preview": "Pattern & Smoke:\n\nAn upper-level ridge will rebuild over the Northern Rockies this \nweekend into early next week. Persistent southwesterly flow aloft \nwill maintain monsoonal moisture transport into the region, \nkeeping precipitable water levels elevated. This pattern will \nsustain daily chances for afternoon showers and thunderstorms \nthrough next week, preventing a full return to dry conditions. \nWildfire smoke will remain an ongoing challenge, with air quality \nexpected to degrade slowly this weekend as southwesterly flow \ntransports smoke plumes from source fires in eastern Washington \nand Oregon.",
